#### 6. **BER Calculation**
```matlab
% MATLAB BER Calculation
function ber = calculateBER(transmitted, received)
    maxLength = max(length(transmitted), length(received));
    transmitted = [transmitted, repmat('0',1,maxLength - length(transmitted))];
    received = [received, repmat('0',1,maxLength - length(received))];
    errors = sum(bitxor(transmitted, received));
    ber = errors / maxLength;
end

% Example Usage
